\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.1}{\ignorespaces Compact local LLM assistant request path: browser UI $\to $ Vite dev proxy $\to $ CWB Express API (SSE) $\to $ LM Studio streaming endpoint $\to $ incremental Markdown rendering in the UI.}}{128}{figure.caption.198}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.2}{\ignorespaces Expanded local LLM assistant data flow with component boundaries: the browser UI streams from the CWB Express API, which proxies to a local OpenAI-compatible model server (LM Studio) over Server-Sent Events. Optional user context is attached when the request is authenticated.}}{129}{figure.caption.199}%
